{
    "title": "Mahjong Solitaire Classic Game",
    "description": "<b>The challenging & addictive Mahjong Solitaire card & puzzle game for you!</b> This beautifully designed puzzle tests your skills through thousands of crafted card matching levels, blending classic Mahjong elements with solitaire strategy.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a seasoned player or new to Mahjong, enhance your reaction and relax with each tile match. Perfect for players seeking a serene escape and a mental workout, the matching game offers a modern twist on a timeless classic for you to experience the charm of traditional Chinese graphics and wisdom.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udc04\ufe0f<b>How to Play Mahjong Solitaire</b>\ud83c\udc04\ufe0f\r\n\ud83d\udcaf Setup: The game begins with up to 144 tiles arranged on the board in various layouts. Each tile features distinct Mahjong symbols.\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Objective: Your goal is to clear the board by finding and matching pairs of tiles with identical symbols or the same themes.\r\n\ud83d\udccc Matching Rules: You can only match tiles that are not covered by other tiles.\r\n\ud83e\uddd7 Progression: Tap or drag to match the tiles. Successfully matching a pair will remove those tiles from the board. Clear all tiles to complete the level and unlock the next one.\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Assistance: Use boosters if you're stuck on a tricky puzzle to help clear the board more easily.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udc04\ufe0f<b>Exciting Features of Mahjong Solitaire</b>\ud83c\udc04\ufe0f\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Stunning Themes\r\nExperience three sets of free Mahjong tiles and backgrounds, beautifully crafted with minimalist, pet, and classic styles.\r\n\ud83e\udd29 Dynamic Audiovisuals\r\nEnjoy smooth animations paired with soothing sound effects for a superior visual and auditory tile-matching experience.\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Extensive Puzzles\r\nTackle over 10,000 solvable matching levels with a balance of challenge and relaxation, perfect for all skill levels.\r\n\ud83d\ude0c User-Friendly Interface\r\nNavigate through the game with simple and intuitive controls for the easiest mahjong gameplay.\r\n\ud83d\udd29 Unlimited Undos\r\nMake use of free, unlimited undos to seamlessly overcome challenging mahjong solitaire levels.\r\n\ud83d\ude0e Adaptive Tile Sizing\r\nTiles automatically resize for optimal screen fit and increase in size as fewer remain, ensuring easy readability.\r\n\ud83e\udd73 Stay tuned for updates:\r\nWe're committed to enhancing your gaming experience with new features. Share your feedback and let us know what improvements you'd like to see in Mahjong Solitaire!\r\n\r\nWhether you are seeking tranquility or stimulating brain exercises, our Mahjong Solitaire puzzle game perfectly balances Zen and puzzle-solving excitement. Dive into the world of card matching today and explore a rich, interactive environment filled with challenging puzzles and engaging features.\r\n\r\nExperience the challenge and calm of Mahjong Solitaire! Can you complete all 10,000+ levels? Play for free and enjoy the serene journey of tile matching!\r\n\r\nTerms of Service: https://mahjong.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://mahjong.gurugame.ai/policy.html",
